Checkpoint artifacts under predict/ and transfer/ are licensed under the
NVIDIA-OneWay-Noncommercial-License, except for artifacts explicitly identified
as OpenMDW-1.1 in release-manifest.json.

Full license text: https://developer.download.nvidia.com/licenses/NVIDIA-OneWay-Noncommercial-License-22Mar2022.pdf

OpenMDW-1.1 checkpoints
-----------------------

Only checkpoint artifacts under openmdw-1.1/ that are explicitly identified
with license_id "OpenMDW-1.1" in release-manifest.json are licensed under the
OpenMDW License Agreement, version 1.1.

Full license text: https://github.com/OpenMDW/OpenMDW/blob/main/1.1/LICENSE.OpenMDW-1.1

Existing checkpoint artifacts are not relicensed. See NOTICE.weights and
release-manifest.json for origin notices, artifact paths, and checksums.
